{
  "id": "ep45-vo-02",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "01",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "假如说，你是圆明园的马首。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "01.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "假如说你是原名原的马手",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "name": "02",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "有人花六千九百一十万港元买下你，",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "02.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "有人花6,910万港元买下你",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "03",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "又把你捐了出去。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "03.mp3",
      "bytes": 29300,
      "heard": "又把你捐了出去",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "name": "04",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你被人抢走，",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "04.mp3",
      "bytes": 26792,
      "heard": "你被人抢走",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 1.6
    },
    {
      "name": "05",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "被一锤子卖掉，",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "05.mp3",
      "bytes": 26792,
      "heard": "被一锤子卖掉",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 1.6
    },
    {
      "name": "06",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "差点又上了拍卖台，",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "06.mp3",
      "bytes": 33061,
      "heard": "差點又上了拍賣台",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 2.0
    },
    {
      "name": "07",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "终于，你回了家。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "07.mp3",
      "bytes": 33061,
      "heard": "终于你回了家",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.993,
      "seconds": 2.0
    },
    {
      "name": "08",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "可十二个里，还有五个没回中国。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "08.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "可十二个里还有五个没回中国",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.988,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "09",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "乾隆年间，你由红铜一次铸成。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "09.mp3",
      "bytes": 57303,
      "heard": "乾隆年间,你又红桐一次铸成",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "name": "10",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你和十一个兄弟，坐在水池两边。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "10.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "你和十一個兄弟坐在水池兩邊",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "11",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "每两小时，轮到谁，谁就喷水。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "11.mp3",
      "bytes": 53541,
      "heard": "每两小时,轮到谁,谁就喷水",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.28
    },
    {
      "name": "12",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你，是午时。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "12.mp3",
      "bytes": 33061,
      "heard": "你是五十",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.991,
      "seconds": 2.0
    },
    {
      "name": "13",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "正午十二点，十二个一起喷水。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "13.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "正午十二点,十二个一起喷水",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "14",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一八六零年，英法联军进了园子。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "14.mp3",
      "bytes": 54795,
      "heard": "1860年,英法联军进入原子",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.36
    },
    {
      "name": "15",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "能搬走的，都被搬走了。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "15.mp3",
      "bytes": 41838,
      "heard": "能搬走的都被搬走了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 2.56
    },
    {
      "name": "16",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "然后，一把火。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "16.mp3",
      "bytes": 38077,
      "heard": "然后一把火",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 2.32
    },
    {
      "name": "17",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你被带走了。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "17.mp3",
      "bytes": 24284,
      "heard": "你被带走了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 1.44
    },
    {
      "name": "18",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一百多年后，你出现在伦敦。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "18.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "一百多年后,你出现在伦敦",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "19",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "锤子落下：三四十万美元。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "19.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "錘子落下,三四十萬美元",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "20",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你被台湾收藏家买走。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "20.mp3",
      "bytes": 35569,
      "heard": "你被台灣收藏家埋走",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.16
    },
    {
      "name": "21",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "牛、猴、虎、猪，先后被买回中国。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "21.mp3",
      "bytes": 71514,
      "heard": "牛,猴,虎,猪,先后被买回中国",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.991,
      "seconds": 4.4
    },
    {
      "name": "22",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "二零零七年，你又要上拍了。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "22.mp3",
      "bytes": 44764,
      "heard": "2007年,你又要上拍了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 2.72
    },
    {
      "name": "23",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "这一次，锤子没有落下。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "23.mp3",
      "bytes": 41838,
      "heard": "这一次锤子没有落下",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 2.56
    },
    {
      "name": "24",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "国家文物局反对公开拍卖。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "24.mp3",
      "bytes": 43510,
      "heard": "国家文物局反对公开排卖",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.64
    },
    {
      "name": "25",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "拍卖前，何鸿燊私下买下了你：",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "25.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "拍賣前 何宏申私下買下了你",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.992,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "26",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "六千九百一十万港元。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "26.mp3",
      "bytes": 38077,
      "heard": "6,910万港元",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 2.32
    },
    {
      "name": "27",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "比伦敦那次，贵了二十多倍。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "27.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "比倫敦那次貴了二十多倍",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.992,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "28",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "兄弟鼠和兔，在巴黎上拍。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "28.mp3",
      "bytes": 44764,
      "heard": "兄弟鼠和兔在巴黎上拍",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.72
    },
    {
      "name": "29",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "锤子落下，两个共拍出三千一百四十九万欧元。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "29.mp3",
      "bytes": 75275,
      "heard": "锤子落下,两个供拍出3149万欧元。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.64
    },
    {
      "name": "30",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "五天后，买家却说：这个款不能付。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "30.mp3",
      "bytes": 65244,
      "heard": "五天后,买家却说,这个款不能付。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 4.0
    },
    {
      "name": "31",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一个法国家族，把鼠和兔无偿捐回。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "31.mp3",
      "bytes": 67752,
      "heard": "一个法国家族把鼠和兔无常捐回",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 4.16
    },
    {
      "name": "32",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "何鸿燊，也把你捐给了国家。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "32.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "何洪深也把你捐给了国家",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.993,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "33",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "二零二零年五月，何鸿燊去世，九十八岁。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "33.mp3",
      "bytes": 75275,
      "heard": "2020年5月,何宏申去世,98歲",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 4.64
    },
    {
      "name": "34",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他没等到，你回家的那天。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "34.mp3",
      "bytes": 44764,
      "heard": "他沒等到你回家的那天",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.72
    },
    {
      "name": "35",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "同年十二月一日，",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "35.mp3",
      "bytes": 30554,
      "heard": "同年12月1日",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.993,
      "seconds": 1.84
    },
    {
      "name": "36",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你回到了圆明园。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "36.mp3",
      "bytes": 28046,
      "heard": "你回到了袁明元",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 1.68
    },
    {
      "name": "37",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你离开了一百六十年。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "37.mp3",
      "bytes": 38077,
      "heard": "你离开了160年",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.32
    },
    {
      "name": "38",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "十二个里，回到中国的有七个。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "38.mp3",
      "bytes": 51034,
      "heard": "12个礼 回到中国的有7个",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "name": "39",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "今夏杭州，人们排几小时看你兄弟。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "39.mp3",
      "bytes": 63990,
      "heard": "今夏 杭州 人们排几小时看你兄弟",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.995,
      "seconds": 3.92
    },
    {
      "name": "40",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "如今回到圆明园的，只有你。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "40.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "如今回到圆明圆的只有你",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "name": "41",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "你住进园里唯一幸存的古建筑。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "41.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "你住进原里唯一倖存的古建筑",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "42",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "细看，你有一只耳朵是卷的。",
      "voice": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "voice_id": "APSIkVZudNbPAwyPoeVO",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "42.mp3",
      "bytes": 51034,
      "heard": "细看,你有一只耳朵是卷的",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "name": "43",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "研究的人说：你这一路被撞过。",
